Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 19:22:23 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(world): render connected redstone wire shapes

Bedrock sends redstone wire power without its horizontal shape, while Java requires connection states for rendering. Derive those states from neighboring blocks when chunks are encoded and after live block updates. Refresh already sent borders when adjacent chunks appear or unload so wires remain connected across chunk boundaries.
